{
  "title": "Sync the iOS meal-plan outbox when the network comes back",
  "description": "MealPlanStore (ramekin-ios/Ramekin/MealPlanStore.swift) syncs when the account is set, when the meal-plan tab appears, on pull-to-refresh, and after each edit. \
Unlike ShoppingListStore, it has no NWPathMonitor, so meal-plan edits made offline wait until one of those happens instead of going out as soon as the phone is back online. \
Share one network monitor between the two stores (or move the shopping list's into a small shared helper) and have it call MealPlanStore.syncWithServer when the path becomes satisfied and edits are pending. iOS only: web has no outbox (doc/web-sync.md).",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 4,
  "type": "task",
